# Xanthos, master builder of the king's tomb out on the steppe, at the mouth of
# its dromos. Three questions: whose tomb, how the vault holds, where the stone
# comes from; and a word on the mason's mark once the player has seen it.
# Text is a key: the panel translates it, so EN/RU stay in strings.csv.
# Indent with tabs: DM's INDENT_REGEX is ^\t+.

~ start
Xanthos: NPC_BUILDER_1
- LOC_BUILDER_CHOICE_1
	Xanthos: LOC_BUILDER_WHOSE_1
	Xanthos: LOC_BUILDER_WHOSE_2
- LOC_BUILDER_CHOICE_2
	Xanthos: LOC_BUILDER_VAULT_1
	Xanthos: LOC_BUILDER_VAULT_2
- LOC_BUILDER_CHOICE_3
	Xanthos: LOC_BUILDER_STONE_1
- LOC_BUILDER_CHOICE_SAW [if Game.has_found("mason_mark")]
	Xanthos: LOC_BUILDER_SAW_1
=> END
